{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22549","headline":"春中与卢四周谅华阳观同居 · 白居易","name":"春中与卢四周谅华阳观同居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"性情嬾慢好相亲，门巷萧条称作邻。\n背烛共怜深夜月，蹋花同惜少年春。\n杏坛住僻虽宜病，芸阁官微不救贫。\n文行如君尚顦顇，不知霄汉待何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22549.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22549","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}